    "solution": "\\(\\sin\\theta=-\\tfrac12\\), reference angle \\(\\tfrac{\\pi}{6}\\); sine is negative in Q3 and Q4, giving \\(\\theta=\\pi+\\tfrac{\\pi}{6}=\\tfrac{7\\pi}{6}\\) and \\(2\\pi-\\tfrac{\\pi}{6}=\\tfrac{11\\pi}{6}\\)."
