    "solution": "\\(\\sin^{-1}\\tfrac45\\) has \\(\\cos=\\tfrac35\\); \\(\\cos^{-1}\\tfrac{12}{13}\\) has \\(\\sin=\\tfrac{5}{13}\\). \\(\\alpha=\\sin(A+B)=\\tfrac45\\cdot\\tfrac{12}{13}+\\tfrac35\\cdot\\tfrac{5}{13}=\\tfrac{48+15}{65}=\\tfrac{63}{65}\\)."
  },
  {
    "id": "a0821b69-1aa9-4d23-b4e2-e11678e56dc3",
    "ref": "Misc I Q.14",
