    "solution": "\\(\\tfrac{2x+3x}{1-6x^2}=1\\Rightarrow6x^2+5x-1=0\\Rightarrow(6x-1)(x+1)=0\\); \\(x=-1\\) gives a negative sum, so \\(x=\\tfrac16\\)."
  },
  {
