    "ref": "Misc I Q.15",
    "derived_answer": "D",
    "solution": "\\(2\\tan^{-1}\\tfrac13=\\tan^{-1}\\tfrac{2/3}{1-1/9}=\\tan^{-1}\\tfrac34\\); then \\(\\tan^{-1}\\tfrac34+\\tan^{-1}\\tfrac17=\\tan^{-1}\\tfrac{3/4+1/7}{1-3/28}=\\tan^{-1}1=\\tfrac{\\pi}{4}\\)."
  },
  {
    "id": "30aa9918-9ddb-40ed-831c-2ec8bb137714",
    "ref": "Misc I Q.16",
